+class _OpenAITransport:
+    """OpenAI-API transport with the Ark client's call surface.
+
+    _call_impl invokes client.batch.chat.completions.create(model=...,
+    messages=..., tools=...); this class exposes exactly that path on top of
+    the official OpenAI Python client. The SDK's own retries are disabled so
+    the authors' tenacity policy in ArkBatchClient remains the only retry
+    layer. No temperature or other generation parameter is added or removed:
+    the call kwargs pass through untouched, exactly as on the Ark path.
+    """
